#post1467219\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I just know of Justin Achilli and I guess Matthew Dawkins will be on board</div> </div> </div> </div>Matthew\u2019s not involved. He was when it was being done by Hunter Entertainment, but since Paradox took it in house Matthew has publicly said he\u2019s not part of it, and the only person publicly connected with W5 is Justin.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Writer. Developer.</i> <b>World of Darkness</b> | <b>Chronicles of Darkness</b> | <b>The Trinity Continuum</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/156-bunyip","name":"Bunyip","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar156_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1880"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-11-09T06:53:09-08:00","id":1467256,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Saur Ops Specialist</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1463892-after-much-speculation-some-new-w5-official-information?p=1467225#post1467225\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Given the name's links to an actual, real life movement, that might be a bit too loaded to use.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yep, that's what I meant. Use the idea (the tribes fighting together), expand it (the camp grows into a unified tribe) and change it's name (to respect any religious sensitivities) from Ghost Dance to Ghost Council.<br /> <br /> Ghost Council = Ghost Dance on steroids<br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/mxyvsy9\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/a/img19/986/w20supporterheavymetal1.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/k5qe4j4\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/a/img546/6111/wpur.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/nd6kms2\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2766-wolfen","name":"Wolfen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2766_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"45"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-11-09T07:01:07-08:00","id":1467258,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Bunyip</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1463892-after-much-speculation-some-new-w5-official-information?p=1467237#post1467237\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Matthew\u2019s not involved. He was when it was being done by Hunter Entertainment, but since Paradox took it in house Matthew has publicly said he\u2019s not part of it, and the only person publicly connected with W5 is Justin.</div> </div> </div> </div>That's sad. Matthew certainly knows and loves the game, and seems to seems to communicate well with the fanbase...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/mxyvsy9\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/a/img19/986/w20supporterheavymetal1.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/k5qe4j4\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/a/img546/6111/wpur.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/nd6kms2\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2766-wolfen","name":"Wolfen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2766_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"45"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-11-11T15:18:47-08:00","id":1467487,"title":"","content":"Well the Parawolf has its own vision of what the games should be and they're more interested in nurturting a fanbase for that then to engaging with the old people.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:arial\">What doesn't kill you, makes you...<i> stranger</i>.</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1182-asmodai","name":"Asmodai","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1182_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2989"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-11-12T05:46:58-08:00","id":1467541,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Asmodai</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1463892-after-much-speculation-some-new-w5-official-information?p=1467487#post1467487\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Well the Parawolf has its own vision of what the games should be and they're more interested in nurturting a fanbase for that then to engaging with the old people.</div> </div> </div> </div>And we've already seen what happens when they do it with movies, TV shows, comics...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/mxyvsy9\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/a/img19/986/w20supporterheavymetal1.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/k5qe4j4\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/a/img546/6111/wpur.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/nd6kms2\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2766-wolfen","name":"Wolfen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2766_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"45"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-11-12T06:11:46-08:00","id":1467546,"title":"","content":"Can someone explain why the wendigo name is so bad when so many of the other tribes have stupid fucking names too?<br /> <br /> <br /> RE: Star wars and deleting canon. <br /> Disney definitely did the right thing in demoting all that expanded universe stuff, especially as they intended to bring the better ideas forth. People tend to remember the greats and forget the awful, and the EU had a lot of awful. If Disney had a half decent replacement for it, it would've been a 10/10 decision. Alas, they shat the bed and the stains will last a hundred years. But if WW wanted to delete the metaplot while keeping with the core game and come up with something better, I'd welcome that.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":25794,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25794-mywifeisscary","user":"MyWifeIsScary","date":". 11-12-2021, 09:20 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25794-mywifeisscary","name":"MyWifeIsScary","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25794_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3711"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-11-12T06:22:19-08:00","id":1467548,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Wolfen</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1463892-after-much-speculation-some-new-w5-official-information?p=1467541#post1467541\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">And we've already seen what happens when they do it with movies, TV shows, comics...</div> </div> </div> </div>Well we've seen spectacular successes and horrible failures, as well as a endless treadmill of reboots and revamps of things that used to be cool. So far we've not seen a mainstream success from Parawolf, and I'd be quite wary of applying the same rules of how you build a fanbase for a mainstream property to the RPG's. Their big and brave multi brand initiative has so far created a number of middling computer games, a bunch of promises of big multimedia content and a divisive RPG that caused a international incident and had its dev team buried in the backyard, and didn't even have a big impact on any of the sales charts.<br /> <br /> 6 years in it's not looking like the best plan ever.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:arial\">What doesn't kill you, makes you...<i> stranger</i>.</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1182-asmodai","name":"Asmodai","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1182_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2989"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-11-12T06:37:33-08:00","id":1467551,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Asmodai</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1463892-after-much-speculation-some-new-w5-official-information?p=1467548#post1467548\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Well we've seen spectacular successes and horrible failures, as well as a endless treadmill of reboots and revamps of things that used to be cool.</div> </div> </div> </div>The spectacular successes only happened when the existing fanbase was respected. Ignore what you have to chase what you don't have and it's likely you'll end up empty handed.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Asmodai</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1463892-after-much-speculation-some-new-w5-official-information?p=1467548#post1467548\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">6 years in it's not looking like the best plan ever.</div> </div> </div> </div>To think that W20 was going so well...<br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/mxyvsy9\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/a/img19/986/w20supporterheavymetal1.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/k5qe4j4\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/a/img546/6111/wpur.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/nd6kms2\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2766-wolfen","na